# NBBF-CWC #43 — restore-worktree freeze byte identity
#
# Scope: this directory tree only
#   reconciliation-evidence/restore-worktree-freeze/**
#
# Purpose: override repository-root `* text=auto` so frozen historical
# evidence is stored without CRLF/LF conversion.
#
# `-text` disables Git newline conversion. It is not repository-wide
# binary treatment and does not change:
#   - controls/*.md
#   - controls/manifest.txt
#   - ordinary project Markdown outside this tree
#   - other repositories
#
# Generated CWC metadata in this tree (README/INVENTORY) is included by
# the directory-scoped pattern so it cannot be renormalized later; those
# files are not external source evidence.
** -text
